019t just 2D action\u2015it's a &quot;date&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The adventure begins with a mission to protect the city from the mysterious invaders!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600700/extras/93a1ba66b40098eec7df166ae1a45f57.poster.avif?t=1769791067\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600700/extras/93a1ba66b40098eec7df166ae1a45f57.webm?t=1769791067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>An odd and oddly cheerful alien group, the &quot;Hateful Fruit Company,&quot; has begun its annoying invasion of peaceful Shinjuku City. Their motives? Unclear. But as you and Coneru progress through your action-packed date, the truth will unravel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon and Beam Combo Attacks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You melee attack with your weapon! Coneru attacks from a distance with &quot;Conerun Beam&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600700/extras/15a41bad84761bfc6f4bab2ba24e0433.poster.avif?t=1769791067\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600700/extras/15a41bad84761bfc6f4bab2ba24e0433.webm?t=1769791067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600700/extras/135b50d73abe5a881325af9e3d86