pan></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Conerun Talk&quot;: Endless Chatter!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you battle through this action-packed date, Coneru reacts to everything around with her  expressions. After all, this is a date! Why fight with a serious face when you can chat, smile, and slash enemies while laughing together?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600700/extras/f3e7eeb48a120e4f47f914ca165bdfac.avif?t=1769791067\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Date to Remember</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, your soul and Coneru\u2019s, two beings from different dimensions, unite as one. Embark on a special date that you can only experience in this unique 2D action adventure. It\u2019ll be a date you'll never forget!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600700/extras/c61a329a9914b1bb657a7c8105aa43cc.avif?t=1769791067\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p>","developers":["HIKE Inc.","Eallin Japan Co.Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600700/header.jpg?t=1769791067","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2600700/74757735/ae8e230bcf883d1ec679b02665951ac9dc4d8250/1762311850/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762313694",